If the model uses query and value instead of q_proj and v_proj, update the config accordingly:

"target_modules": ["query", "value"]

If you're using a LLaMA-based model

"target_modules": ["self_attn.q_proj", "self_attn.v_proj"]

Example Fix for GPT Models
For GPT-based models

q_proj → attn.c_attn (combined query, key, and value projections)

v_proj → attn.c_proj (output projection)

